      "id": "sol.ahsme-1962-p17.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Changing to base \\(2\\) gives \\[ \\begin{aligned} a&=\\frac{\\log_2(15^2)}{\\log_2(2^3)}\\\\ &=\\frac{2\\log_2 15}{3} =\\frac{2b}{3}. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is B.",
